 the <i>Natural History,</i> by Pliny the Elder (23-79 A.D.), which deal with plants and also with remedies made from them: <a href=\"https://archive.org/details/pliny-natural-history-bostock-index\" rel=\"ugc nofollow\">Volumes Guide to Pliny's Natural History.</a></div><div><br />Note: the Greek and English texts are best displayed with the pages \"side by side\" (\"two up\" or \"facing\"). Pdf readers (such as Foxit and Adobe) have this option under the menu item View/Page Display.<br /></div><div><br /></div><div>Theophrastus' <i>Enquiry into Plants:</i><br /></div><div><br /></div><div>Book 1. The Parts of Plants and Their Composition <br />Book 2. Propagation, especially of Trees <br />Book 3. Wild Trees <br /></div><div><br /></div><div>Book 4. The Trees and Plants Special to Particular Districts and Positions <br />Book 5. The Timber of Various Trees and Its Uses <br />Book 6. Under-Shrubs <br /></div><div><br /></div><div>Book 7. Herbaceous Plants, Other than Coronary Plants: Pot-herbs and Similar Wild Herbs <br />Book 8. Herbaceous Plants: Cereals, Pulses, and 'Summer Crops' <br />Book 9. The Juices of Plants and the Medicinal Properties of Herbs<br /></div>","scanner":"Internet Archive HTML5 Uploader 1.7.0","subject":["History","Historical","Ancient","Botany","Botanical","Plants","Trees","Shrubs","Classifications","Medicines","Drugs","Ethnobotany","Flora","Remedies","Cures","Homeopathy","Science","Odors","Smells","Weather","Climate","Natural History"],"title":"Theophrastus. Enquiry into Plants and Minor Works","uploader":"rbedrosian@gmail.com","publicdate":"2023-12-02 03:34:55","addeddate":"2023-12-02 03:34:55","curation":"[curator]validator@archive.org[/curator][date]20231202034214[/date][comment]checked for malware[/comment]","identifier-access":"http://archive.org/details/theophrastus-enquiry-plants-loeb","identifier-ark":"ark:/13960/s2nhfkxm825","ppi":"600","page_number_confidence":"100","page_number_module_version":"1.0.3","ocr":"tesseract 5.3.0-6-g7